<p><a href="/conveyor-types/flat-belt-conveyors/">Belt material selection</a> for sanitary conveyors balances four factors: FDA compliance, chemical resistance to cleaning agents, cleanability (surface texture and porosity), and detection capability (metal-detectable or X-ray detectable materials). The belt is the primary food-contact surface and the most frequently cleaned component on the conveyor.</p>
